    "reason": "[ev-2c2bce4c1f26] names the Helm option only as `wireguard.userspaceFallback` and says the fallback is deprecated but still present. A values-key exposure on that option would fit a deprecation. However, the values validator found no such key in the chart values of either release [ev-28e0ccb5774a] [ev-39a22d88e2f5]. A predicate on that path would then never match, and it would miss environments that turn the fallback on under its real key. No upstream excerpt gives the full values path, or says whether only `true` (rather than any explicit setting) counts as using the fallback. I need the chart values.yaml entry for this option to settle the exposure condition.",
